  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FIJI &#xbf; Time to Act! Implementing the Climate Change Act</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(251, 251, 251); color: rgb(83, 83, 83);&quot;&gt;The sector reform performance contract aims to contribute to Fiji&#xbf;s sustainable, inclusive and resilient low carbon development. More specifically, it will facilitate the entry into force of the Climate Change Act, a comprehensive legal basis enacted in 2021 to support Fiji&#xbf;s sustainable development objectives, long-term climate ambition, net-zero emissions target, and commitment to protecting Fiji&apos;s environment, so that a conducive environment for the implementation of climate actions is created.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
